*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.doc binary
*.xls binary
*.ppt binary
*.odt binary
*.ods binary
*.odp binary
*.wasm binary
*.bcmap binary
*.pfb binary
*.ttf binary
*.icc binary
*.png binary
